                <pb facs="0686" n="666" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg666"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Executive Mansion,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-07-30"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 30, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>The Executive order of the 14th of April, 1862, prohibiting the exportation of
                    anthracite coal, is hereby modified so far as to permit such exportation to
                    Canada except by sea. This modification will remain in force so long only as the
                    Canadian government shall prevent the exportation or use of the article in
                    sea-going vessels.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>ABRAHAM LINCOLN.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
